---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABlock from '../components/CTABlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Heurystics"
  description="Two people. Deep capability. Obsessive focus on real estate operations. Heurystics is a focused AI consultancy based in Stockholm."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <h1 class="fade-up">Two people. Deep capability. Obsessive focus on real estate operations.</h1>
      <p class="lead fade-up delay-1" style="margin-top: 16px;">
        Heurystics exists for one reason: to make your operations run themselves.
        We don't do "any industry" and we don't do "AI strategy workshops."
        We deliver measurable operational outcomes for real estate companies.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="team-grid">
        <!-- Aman -->
        <div class="team-member fade-up">
          <img src="/images/aman.jpg" alt="Aman — Technical lead at Heurystics" class="team-photo" />
          <h3>Aman</h3>
          <span class="team-role">Technical lead</span>
          <p>The person who makes the outcomes happen. Every system Aman has built runs in production, handles real transactions, and delivers measurable results — not proofs of concept that sit on staging servers.</p>
          <p>Delivered a 20% revenue lift for a $100M+ retail chain through AI-integrated operations across 10 locations. Built the autonomous system now serving 650 customers including 50 real estate companies. Created the intelligence model that turned the same $5M ad budget into 83% more revenue for a $1.5B enterprise.</p>
          <div class="team-tags">
            <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tag">Python</span>
            <span class="tag">Mastra</span>
            <span class="tag">MCP</span>
            <span class="tag">RAG</span>
            <span class="tag">AWS</span>
            <span class="tag">Supabase</span>
            <span class="tag">Turso</span>
          </div>
          <p class="team-note">Part of the BLING incubator ecosystem. Guest lecturer at Stockholm Business School's Executive MBA programme.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pallav -->
        <div class="team-member fade-up delay-1">
          <img src="/images/pallav.jpg" alt="Pallav — GTM lead at Heurystics" class="team-photo" />
          <h3>Pallav</h3>
          <span class="team-role">GTM lead</span>
          <p>Business development and go-to-market strategy. Leads all client conversations, partnership development, and market positioning. Translates deep technical capability into business value for platform companies.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why We Exist -->
  <section class="section section-limestone">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 640px; text-align: center;">
      <div class="editorial fade-up">
        <p>Real estate firms are losing deals, leaking revenue, and burning hours on work that should be running itself. The data to fix all of it already exists inside your systems — nobody is acting on it.</p>
        <p>We turn that data into outcomes. Fewer missed deadlines. Recovered commission revenue. Listings that launch the same day they're signed. Closing files that don't stall. These aren't promises on a roadmap — they're results you see in weeks.</p>
        <p>We don't sell software. We partner with the companies doing the work — brokerages, title companies, escrow operations — and we take over the workflows that are costing them time and money.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="process-timeline">
        <div class="process-step fade-up">
          <div class="process-circle">
            <span class="process-num mono">01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-content">
            <h4>Assessment <span class="process-meta">&middot; Free &middot; 30 min</span></h4>
            <p>We identify which operational problems are costing you the most money and time. You walk away with a clear picture of what changes first, how fast, and what the revenue impact looks like — whether you hire us or not.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process-line"></div>

        <div class="process-step fade-up delay-1">
          <div class="process-circle">
            <span class="process-num mono">02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-content">
            <h4>Pilot <span class="process-meta">&middot; 2-4 weeks</span></h4>
            <p>You see the first outcome — usually zero missed deadlines or recovered commission revenue. We start with whichever problem delivers the fastest visible ROI. Real data, real workflows, real results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process-line"></div>

        <div class="process-step fade-up delay-2">
          <div class="process-circle">
            <span class="process-num mono">03</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-content">
            <h4>Production <span class="process-meta">&middot; Ongoing</span></h4>
            <p>The outcomes compound. We measure results, optimize, and expand to additional problems. Your operations improve month over month. Your data never leaves your environment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABlock />

</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .team-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .team-member {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .team-avatar {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 28px;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .navy-avatar { background: var(--navy); }
  .ochre-avatar { background: var(--ochre); }

  .team-role {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ochre);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .team-member p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--driftwood);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .team-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .team-note {
    font-size: 13px !important;
    color: var(--sandstone) !important;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Editorial */
  .editorial p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--timber);
  }

  .editorial p + p {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  /* Process timeline */
  .process-timeline {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .process-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .process-circle {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--limestone);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--nordic-light);
  }

  .process-num {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .process-content {
    flex: 1;
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  .process-content h4 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .process-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--sandstone);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .process-content p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--driftwood);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .process-line {
    width: 2px;
    height: 32px;
    background: var(--limestone);
    margin-left: 27px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .team-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
